<title>USA: Reuters 10th ex-Miami air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 10th ex-Miami air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current air freight rates from Miami International airport to key destinations in Latin America and Europe. These rates are exclusive of cargo fuel surchages being applied by airlines.</p>
<p>			 March 10     Jan 24</p>
<p>			 BRAZIL</p>
<p> MIA-SAO	     2.05	   2.01</p>
<p>			 COLOMBIA</p>
<p> MIA-BOG	     0.69	   0.61</p>
<p>			 ARGENTINE</p>
<p> MIA-BUE	     1.97	   1.90</p>
<p>			 CHILE</p>
<p> MIA-SCL	     1.85	   1.72</p>
<p>			 EUROPE</p>
<p> MIA-LHR	     1.20	   1.20</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in U.S. Dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market actvity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
